Aim: Create and use a user-defined package.

Algorithm: Start
create package folder 
compile package class
import and use it
stop.

Program:

// Save as pack/Message.java
package pack;
public class Message {
    public void show(){System.out.println("User package");}
}
// Save separately as PackageDemo.java
import pack.Message;
class PackageDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new Message().show();
    }
}

Result: User package. Compile from the parent folder: javac pack/Message.java PackageDemo.java; then java PackageDemo.

